---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Lili David"
  description="Lili David — facilitator, consultant, and coach. About her work, her approach, and what shapes her perspective."
>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-inner">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <h1 class="hero-anim hero-anim--2">
          Where thoughtful <em class="accent-word">structure</em> meets
          the reality of human <em class="accent-word">relationships</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead mt-md hero-anim hero-anim--3">
          I work with people and organizations who want to build ways of working that are both
          effective and deeply human. My focus is on the structures, habits, and relationships
          that allow clarity, participation, and shared responsibility to coexist in practice.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-photo-wrap hero-anim hero-anim--2">
        <img
          src="/images/about-hero-GIF.gif?v=20260401"
          alt="Lili David facilitating a group session"
          class="about-photo"
          onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/about-hero-group-2.jpg';"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wave-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="wave-clip">
      <svg id="about-accent-wave-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="16">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="aboutWaveGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#5B7E6F" />
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#4A6B8A" />
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <path
          id="about-accent-wave-path"
          fill="none"
          stroke="url(#aboutWaveGrad)"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="butt"
        />
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-lg" data-animate="fade-up">
        <h2>The <em class="accent-word">tension</em> that shaped my work</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tension-layout">
        <div class="tension-body" data-animate="fade-right">
          <p>
            My route into this work began in socially oriented and nonprofit projects. I
            was inspired by the care, commitment, and sense of purpose I found there —
            but I also saw how often those qualities were undermined by unhealthy
            dynamics, fuzzy roles, and meetings that went nowhere.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-sm">
            Over time, I realized this was not just a problem in one kind of
            organization. In some places, people cared deeply about participation,
            values, and doing things well together, but lacked the clarity and structure
            needed to move forward. In others, things moved faster, but at the cost of
            ownership, trust, and genuine engagement.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="tension-aside" data-animate="fade-left">
          <div class="tension-card">
            <span class="tension-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M0 12h4l2-4 3 8 3-8 2 4h10"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <p>
              What stayed with me was the tension between those two realities, which
              shaped the direction of my work: helping people build ways of working
              that do not force a choice between effectiveness and humanity.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-lg" data-animate="fade-up">
        <h2>The <em class="accent-word">path</em> I followed</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="path-inner">
        <div class="path-media" data-animate="fade-right">
          <div class="path-image-wrap">
            <img
              src="/images/lili-about-front.png"
              alt="Lili David at work"
              class="path-image is-active"
              data-path-image
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/lili-about-path-2.jpg?v=20260401b"
              alt="Lili David facilitating with visual tools"
              class="path-image path-image--second"
              data-path-image
              onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/lili-about-front.png';"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
            />
            <img
              src="/images/lili-about-path-3.jpg"
              alt="Lili David speaking on stage"
              class="path-image"
              data-path-image
              onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/images/lili-about-front.png';"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="path-content" data-animate="fade-left">
          <div class="milestones">
            <div class="milestone">
              <p>
                My path into this work started with a degree in business management and
                later a master&rsquo;s in communications, which gave me language for both
                the structural and relational dimensions of organizational life.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone milestone--highlight">
              <p>
                Discovering sociocracy in 2014 gave me a practical way forward. Soon
                after, I joined the Sociocracy 3.0 development team, and that work
                became one important strand in the approach I&rsquo;ve continued to deepen
                over the years.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone">
              <p>
                My work has also been shaped by other tools, practices, and perspectives,
                including Voice Dialogue, Deep Democracy, and systemic approaches for
                organizational development. I&rsquo;m not loyal to one method. What matters
                most to me is helping people find approaches that genuinely fit their
                context and support healthier, more effective ways of working together.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="milestone milestone--conclusion">
              <p>
                What this path has made clear to me is that people do not have to choose
                between effectiveness and humanity. My work today is about helping create
                the conditions that allow both to coexist in practice.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-lg" data-animate="fade-up">
        <h2><em class="accent-word">Principles</em> that guide my work</h2>
        <p class="mt-sm" style="margin-inline: auto;">
          Over the years, this work has led me toward an approach that is both systemic
          and practical — paying attention not only to visible issues, but also to the
          patterns, conditions, and relationships that shape them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="approach-grid">
        <div class="approach-item" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="0">
          <h3>Systemic perspective</h3>
          <p>
            I pay attention to the patterns and conditions that shape behaviour — not just
            the behaviour itself. Individual challenges are almost always connected to
            structural or relational dynamics in the wider system.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-item" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="80">
          <h3>Practical focus</h3>
          <p>
            I am interested in what actually changes — not just what is understood. My
            work is oriented toward practical shifts: in how decisions get made, how
            responsibilities are held, how people communicate.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-item" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="160">
          <h3>Respect for context</h3>
          <p>
            There is no single method that works everywhere. I take time to understand
            each organization&rsquo;s situation before suggesting anything. Solutions
            that don&rsquo;t fit the context rarely stick.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="approach-item" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="240">
          <h3>Supporting autonomy</h3>
          <p>
            I aim to leave organizations with more capacity, not more dependency. The goal
            is not for you to need me indefinitely — it is for you to understand your own
            patterns well enough to navigate them yourselves.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark cta-section">
    <div class="container text-center" data-animate="fade-up">
      <span class="label" style="color: var(--stone-dark);">Let&rsquo;s talk</span>
      <h2 style="color: var(--stone);">Curious whether this could be useful?</h2>
      <p class="lead mt-md" style="color: var(--stone-mid); margin-inline: auto;">
        I&rsquo;m always glad to have an initial conversation — to hear about your context
        and share honestly whether I think I can help.
      </p>
      <div class="flex-row mt-lg" style="justify-content: center;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="/working-together" class="btn btn--outline-light">Working Together &rarr;</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lilidavidis/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn--outline-light">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink:0;">
            <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/>
          </svg>
          LinkedIn &#8599;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  const targets = document.querySelectorAll('[data-animate]');
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          const el = entry.target as HTMLElement;
          const delay = parseInt(el.dataset.delay ?? '0', 10);
          setTimeout(() => el.classList.add('is-visible'), delay);
          observer.unobserve(el);
        }
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' }
  );
  targets.forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));

  // Timeline dots: change from light to green as milestones enter view.
  const milestoneNodes = document.querySelectorAll('.milestone');
  if (milestoneNodes.length > 0) {
    const milestoneObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
      (entries) => {
        entries.forEach((entry) => {
          const el = entry.target as HTMLElement;
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            el.classList.add('is-active');
          } else if (entry.boundingClientRect.top > 0) {
            // Remove active state when scrolling back above this point.
            el.classList.remove('is-active');
          }
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.5, rootMargin: '0px 0px -10% 0px' }
    );

    milestoneNodes.forEach((node) => milestoneObserver.observe(node));
  }

  const reducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  if (!reducedMotion) {
    const pathSection = document.querySelector('.path-inner') as HTMLElement | null;
    const pathMedia = document.querySelector('.path-media') as HTMLElement | null;
    const milestones = document.querySelector('.milestones') as HTMLElement | null;
    const pathImages = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-path-image]')) as HTMLElement[];
    const disablePathMotion = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 900px)').matches;

    if (pathSection && pathMedia && milestones) {
      let ticking = false;
      let activeImageIndex = 0;
      const updatePathMotion = () => {
        ticking = false;
        const rect = pathSection.getBoundingClientRect();
        const vh = window.innerHeight || document.documentElement.clientHeight;
        const raw = (vh - rect.top) / (vh + rect.height);
        const progress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, raw));
        const startThreshold = 0.22;
        const delayed = Math.max(0, (progress - startThreshold) / (1 - startThreshold));
        const eased = delayed * delayed * (3 - 2 * delayed);
        if (!disablePathMotion) {
          const travel = Math.max(0, milestones.offsetHeight - pathMedia.offsetHeight);
          // Use whole-pixel translation to avoid subpixel softening on images.
          const offset = Math.round(eased * travel);
          pathMedia.style.transform = `translateY(${offset}px)`;
        } else {
          pathMedia.style.transform = 'none';
        }

        // Switch images by scroll progress while preserving existing media motion.
        if (pathImages.length > 1) {
          // Keep the first image visible longer before advancing the sequence.
          const imageSwitchStart = 0.44;
          const imageProgress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (progress - imageSwitchStart) / (1 - imageSwitchStart)));
          const nextIndex = Math.min(pathImages.length - 1, Math.floor(imageProgress * pathImages.length));
          if (nextIndex !== activeImageIndex) {
            pathImages[activeImageIndex]?.classList.remove('is-active');
            pathImages[nextIndex]?.classList.add('is-active');
            activeImageIndex = nextIndex;
          }
        }
      };
      const requestUpdate = () => {
        if (!ticking) {
          ticking = true;
          requestAnimationFrame(updatePathMotion);
        }
      };
      window.addEventListener('scroll', requestUpdate, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', requestUpdate);
      requestUpdate();
    }
  }

  // Animated wave divider under hero
  (function () {
    const svg = document.getElementById('about-accent-wave-svg') as SVGSVGElement | null;
    const path = document.getElementById('about-accent-wave-path') as SVGPathElement | null;
    const clip = document.querySelector('.wave-clip') as HTMLElement | null;
    if (!svg || !path || !clip) return;

    const reducedMotionWave = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    if (reducedMotionWave) return;

    requestAnimationFrame(() => {
      const W = (clip.parentElement as HTMLElement).getBoundingClientRect().width || window.innerWidth;
      const H = 24;
      const CY = -2;
      const AMPLITUDE = 4.6;
      const POINTS = 180;

      svg.setAttribute('width', String(W));
      svg.setAttribute('height', String(H));
      svg.setAttribute('viewBox', `0 0 ${W} ${H}`);

      function buildFlatPath(): string {
        const pts: string[] = [];
        for (let i = 0; i <= POINTS; i++) {
          const x = (i / POINTS) * W;
          pts.push(`${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${CY.toFixed(2)}`);
        }
        return pts.join(' ');
      }

      function buildWavePacketPath(p: number): string {
        const pts: string[] = [];
        const centerX = W * (0.32 + 0.48 * p);
        const packetWidth = W * 0.34;
        const cycles = 4.5;
        for (let i = 0; i <= POINTS; i++) {
          const x = (i / POINTS) * W;
          const dx = x - centerX;
          const tNorm = dx / (packetWidth / 2);
          const envelope = Math.exp(-Math.pow(tNorm, 2) * 2.2);
          const wave = Math.sin(((dx + packetWidth / 2) / packetWidth) * Math.PI * 2 * cycles);
          const y = CY + AMPLITUDE * wave * envelope;
          pts.push(`${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${x.toFixed(2)} ${y.toFixed(2)}`);
        }
        return pts.join(' ');
      }

      function easeInOut(t: number): number {
        return t < 0.5 ? 2 * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 2) / 2;
      }

      path.setAttribute('d', buildFlatPath());
      clip.style.opacity = '0';
      clip.style.transform = 'translateX(0)';

      const FADE_DELAY = 700;
      const FADE_DURATION = 700;
      const MORPH_DURATION = 2100;
      const HOLD_DURATION = 650;
      const EXIT_DURATION = 1200;

      type Phase = 'waiting' | 'fading' | 'morphing' | 'holding' | 'exiting' | 'done';
      let phase: Phase = 'waiting';
      let phaseStart = 0;
      let animStart: number | null = null;

      function tick(ts: number) {
        if (animStart === null) animStart = ts;

        if (phase === 'waiting') {
          if (ts - animStart >= FADE_DELAY) { phase = 'fading'; phaseStart = ts; }
          requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          return;
        }

        if (phase === 'fading') {
          const t = Math.min((ts - phaseStart) / FADE_DURATION, 1);
          const eased = easeInOut(t);
          clip.style.opacity = String(eased);
          if (t < 1) { requestAnimationFrame(tick); return; }
          clip.style.opacity = '1';
          phase = 'morphing';
          phaseStart = ts;
          requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          return;
        }

        if (phase === 'morphing') {
          const t = Math.min((ts - phaseStart) / MORPH_DURATION, 1);
          path.setAttribute('d', buildWavePacketPath(easeInOut(t)));
          if (t < 1) { requestAnimationFrame(tick); return; }
          phase = 'holding';
          phaseStart = ts;
          requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          return;
        }

        if (phase === 'holding') {
          if (ts - phaseStart >= HOLD_DURATION) { phase = 'exiting'; phaseStart = ts; }
          requestAnimationFrame(tick);
          return;
        }

        if (phase === 'exiting') {
          const t = Math.min((ts - phaseStart) / EXIT_DURATION, 1);
          const eased = t * t;
          clip.style.transform = `translateX(${110 * eased}%)`;
          clip.style.opacity = String(Math.max(0, 1 - eased * 1.4));
          if (t < 1) { requestAnimationFrame(tick); return; }
          phase = 'done';
        }
      }

      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .accent-word {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  [data-animate] {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(22px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s var(--ease), transform 0.7s var(--ease);
  }
  [data-animate="fade-right"] { transform: translateX(-32px); }
  [data-animate="fade-left"] { transform: translateX(32px); }
  [data-animate].is-visible { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

  @keyframes heroFadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .hero-anim { animation: heroFadeUp 0.8s var(--ease) both; }
  .hero-anim--2 { animation-delay: 0.28s; }
  .hero-anim--3 { animation-delay: 0.42s; }

  .about-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-xl));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about-hero-inner {
    width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .about-hero-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    height: auto;
    min-height: auto;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .about-photo-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin-inline: 0;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    height: calc(100% - 40px);
    width: auto;
    min-width: clamp(230px, 28vw, 320px);
    max-height: 460px;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--stone-dark);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 37, 48, 0.1);
    top: 0;
    align-self: end;
  }

  .about-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: calc(23% - 165px) calc(100% - 65px);
    display: block;
    transform: scale(1.18);
    transform-origin: center top;
  }

  .about-hero-copy h1 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.6vw, 2.85rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .about-hero-copy .lead {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .wave-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    height: 0;
    overflow: visible;
    display: block;
    background: transparent;
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .wave-clip {
    width: 100%;
    height: 24px;
    overflow: visible;
    transform: translateY(-15px);
  }

  #about-accent-wave-svg {
    display: block;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .tension-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr; gap: var(--space-lg); align-items: start; }
  .tension-card {
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--eucalyptus);
    border: 1px solid rgba(221, 214, 200, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(40, 52, 58, 0.1);
    animation: tensionBgShift 7.5s linear infinite;
  }
  .tension-card-icon { display: block; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); color: #FFFFFF; }
  .tension-card-icon svg { width: 42px; height: 22px; display: block; }
  .tension-card p { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; color: #EEE8DD; max-width: none; }
  .tension-card p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @keyframes tensionBgShift {
    0% { background-color: var(--eucalyptus); }
    50% { background-color: var(--slate); }
    100% { background-color: var(--eucalyptus); }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .tension-card { animation: none; }
  }

  .path-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 38%) 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem); align-items: start; }
  .path-image-wrap { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/10; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--stone-dark); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(30, 37, 48, 0.08); }
  .path-image-wrap { position: relative; }
  .path-image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transform: translateX(-20px) scale(1.3);
    transform-origin: center center;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.45s var(--ease);
  }
  .path-image--second {
    transform: none;
    object-position: center center;
    transition: none;
  }
  .path-image:nth-of-type(3) {
    transform: translate(-40px, -15px) scale(1.43);
  }
  .path-image.is-active { opacity: 1; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .path-image { transition: none; }
  }

  .milestones { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding-left: 1.5rem; will-change: transform; transition: transform 0.18s linear; }
  .path-media { transition: transform 0.18s linear; }
  .milestones::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.55rem; bottom: 0.55rem; width: 2px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #C7D4CC, #BECBD7); opacity: 0.9; }
  .milestone { position: relative; padding-bottom: var(--space-md); }
  .milestone:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .milestone::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -1.84rem;
    top: 0.42rem;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #D6DFD9;
    border: 2px solid var(--stone);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(190, 203, 215, 0.35);
    transition: background-color 0.35s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.35s var(--ease);
  }
  .milestone.is-active::before {
    background: #4F8A6F;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(79, 138, 111, 0.2);
  }
  .milestone--highlight::before { background: var(--eucalyptus); border-color: var(--eucalyptus-light); width: 10px; height: 10px; left: -1.8rem; }
  .milestone-year { display: block; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--eucalyptus); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .milestone--conclusion p { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

  .approach-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--space-md); }
  .approach-item {
